---
import Feature from "./Feature.astro"
---

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What you get</p>
    <h2>Follow the flow, not the file list.</h2>
    <ul>
      <Feature title="Whole flow, change highlighted">
        Unchanged code on the path is included and collapsed by default; changed code is where
        attention goes.
      </Feature>
      <Feature title="Across repos">
        One trek crosses repos and async boundaries — HTTP calls, queues, events — and each step
        names its repo.
      </Feature>
      <Feature title="Checkable">
        Every link from one step to the next cites the line that causes it. Predicted values are
        labeled as predicted; guessed links and risky spots are flagged.
      </Feature>
      <Feature title="Any agent">
        Your agent builds treks through <code>trek mcp</code>, a standard MCP server.
      </Feature>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    ul {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
